      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unfortunately, Quest 1 is not supported for VRChat anymore, as Meta deprecated the SDK for the Quest 1. Because of this, VRChat has also been deprecated for the Quest 1.\n\nThis means that even if they wanted to, VRChat Team is unable to fix things for the Quest 1. This update appears to have finally broken things, and VRChat will not be able to fix it.",
