      "value": "@{600b668c6a46514dbb4e5c49|full_name}: Not sure if you’ve heard about this event that happened 3 years ago. But Fortnite got into a lawsuit with Apple. This happened during FN C2 S3. But Epic decided to keep the servers for apple devises still running. What if VRC downgraded Oculus Quest 1 players to the update before it broke everything, and then kept the servers for ONLY Oculus Quest 1 players. And VRC wouldn’t update VRC for quest 1. Then Oculus Quest 1 players can only pair up with other Oculus Quest 1 players too. This honestly would save every Quest 1 players the money to get another headset. Including me, I don’t want to buy another headset, and I don’t wanna loose all my other games that I spent money on too. (Not sure if they transfer to the new quest or not)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
