      "value": "@{651e2fea2b34d1440c9bc0ad|full_name}: They'd have to build out infrastructure specifically for quest 1 instances and completely refactor the account and social menu systems. They'd essentially be running and maintaining two versions of the game, one for a very small almost nonexistent userbase, and probably couldn't give a separate build to the store even if they wanted to. I'm sorry, your device is no longer supported. You need a new headset. Your games will remain.",
