      "value": "@{651e2fea2b34d1440c9bc0ad|full_name}: Epic Games is made of unlimited money, and that was a stunt they pulled for publicity to help in a court case of theirs. VRChat unfortunately just does not have those sorts of resources at their disposal. Additionally, a lot of Meta-related stuff would probably break over time, such as Meta-based logins.\n\nI agree, somewhat, it was a pretty short lifespan - but VR is growing rapidly and the Quest 1 already had dated hardware on release. Developing for it going forward wouldn't be feasible.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
